-- Six ways to write a loop, all landing on the same shape (spec 9.3).

please repeat 3 times:
    show "count"
thank you for repeating

please do this 2 times:
    show "again"
thanks

please remember n is 0
please repeat while n is under 3:
    add 1 to n
    show n
thanks

please change n to 0
please repeat until n is 3:
    add 1 to n
    show "up to {n}"
thanks

please remember names is an empty list
please add "a" to names
please add "b" to names
please for every name in names:
    show name
thanks

please repeat for every k from 1 to 3:
    show "k is {k}"
thanks

please count j from 5 to 7:
    show j
thanks

please keep going forever:
    show "once"
    stop repeating
thanks

please repeat for every m from 1 to 5:
    check if m is 3:
        skip to the next one
    thanks
    show m
thanks
